t (on an annualized basis) in October, following a 3.4 percent increase in September. On a year-over-year basis, the series is up 3.1 percent.\nL81: \nL82: On a core basis (excluding food and energy), the sticky-price index rose 4.7 percent (annualized) in October, and its 12-month percent change was 3.1 percent.\nL83: The flexible cut of the CPI—a weighted basket of items that change price relatively frequently—Increased 3.0 percent (annualized) in October and on a year-over-year basis, the series is up 6.2 percent.\nL84: \nL85: Reset\nL86: \nL87: Sticky CPI\nL88: \nL89: [Input] 1-month annualized [Input] 3-month annualized [Input] 12-month [Input] show all\nL90: \nL91: Core Sticky CPI\nL92: \nL93: [Input] 1-month annualized\nL94: \nL95: [Input] 3-month annualized\nL96: \nL97: [Input] 12-month [Input] show all\nL98: \nL99: Flexible CPI\nL100: \nL101: [Input] 1-month annualized\nL102: \nL103: [Input] 3-month annualized\nL104: [Input] 12-month [Input] show all\nL105: \nL106: Core Flexible CPI\nL107: \nL108: [Input] 1-month annualized\nL109: \nL110: [Input] 3-month annualized\nL111: \nL112: [Input] 12-month [Input] show all\nL113: \nL114: View by timeframe:\nL115: \nL116: [Input] 1-month annualized\nL117: \nL118: [Input] 3-month annualized\nL119: \nL120: [Input] 12-month\nL121: ## Subscribe to the Newsletter\nL122: \nL123: Get the inside scoop on our latest events, speeches, research, and more.\nL124: \nL125: Quick Links\nL126: \nL127:   * 【5†Careers】\nL128:   * 【31†Data】\nL129:   * 【35†Events】\nL130:   * 【41†General Information】\nL131:   * 【8†People】\nL132:   * 【36†Podcasts】\nL133:   * 【37†Press Room】\nL134:   * 【12†Visit】\nL135: \nL136: Connect\nL137:   * 【42†LinkedIn†www.linkedin.com】\nL138:   * 【43†Threads†www.threads.com】\nL139:   * 【44†Instagram†www.instagram.com】\nL140:   * 【45†Facebook†www.facebook.com】\nL141:   * 【46†X (Twitter)†x.com】\nL142:   * 【47†YouTube†www.youtube.com】\nL143:   * 【39†Email Subscriptions】\nL144:   * 【48†RSS Feeds】\nL145: \nL146: Copyrigh